</head>

<body class="tt-magic-cursor">

    <!-- Preloader Start -->
    <div class="preloader" role="status" aria-label="Loading page" hidden>
        <span class="preloader-spinner" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    </div>
    <script src="/js/preloader.js"></script>
    <!-- Preloader End -->

    <!-- Magic Cursor Start -->
    <div id="magic-cursor">
        <div id="ball"></div>
    </div>
    <!-- Magic Cursor End -->

    <%- include('../partials/site-header') %>

    <!-- Page header Start -->
    <div class="page-header parallaxie">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="row align-items-center">
                <div class="col-lg-12">
                    <!-- Page Header box Start -->
                    <div class="page-header-box">
                        <h2 class="text-anime-style-3">FAQs</h2>
                        <nav class="wow fadeInUp" data-wow-delay="0.25s">
                            <ol class="breadcrumb">
                                <li><a href="index.html">Home</a></li>
                                <li> FAQs</li>
                            </ol>
                        </nav>                                
                    </div>
                    <!-- Page Header Box End -->
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <!-- Page Header End -->

    <!-- FAQs Section Start -->
    <div class="page-faqs">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="row">
                <!-- Section Title Start -->
                <div class="section-title">
                    <h2 class="text-anime-style-3">Your pet travel <span>questions</span> answered</h2>
                    <p class="wow fadeInUp" data-wow-delay="0.25s">Answers to the questions families ask most about moving pets by road and by air. For help with a specific trip, get in touch.</p>
                </div>
                <!-- Section Title End -->
            </div>

            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-lg-8 col-md-12 offset-lg-2">
                    <!-- FAQs Accordion Start -->
                    <div class="faq-accordion" id="accordion">
                        <div class="accordion-item wow fadeInUp" data-wow-delay="0.25s">
                            <h2 class="accordion-header box-border-linear-gradient" id="headingOne">
                                <button class="accordion-button" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapseOne" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="collapseOne">1. How far in advance should I book?</button>
                            </h2>
                            <div id="collapseOne" class="accordion-collapse collapse show" aria-labelledby="headingOne" data-bs-parent="#accordion">
                                <div class="accordion-body"><p>For ground transport and domestic flights, two to four weeks is ideal. International moves often need one to six months because of vaccination, titer test and permit timelines, so contact us as early as you can.</p></div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="accordion-item wow fadeInUp" data-wow-delay="0.5s">
                            <h2 class="accordion-header box-border-linear-gradient" id="headingTwo">
                                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapseTwo" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseTwo">2. Which pets do you move?</button>
                            </h2>
                            <div id="collapseTwo" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="headingTwo" data-bs-parent="#accordion">
                                <div class="accordion-body"><p>Mostly dogs and cats, plus many birds and small mammals such as rabbits and ferrets. Some breeds, especially snub-nosed (brachycephalic) dogs and cats, have airline restrictions, so ground transport may be the safer choice.</p></div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="accordion-item wow fadeInUp" data-wow-delay="0.75s">
                            <h2 class="accordion-header box-border-linear-gradient" id="headingThree">
                                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapseThree" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseThree">3. Should my pet travel by road or by air?</button>
                            </h2>
                            <div id="collapseThree" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="headingThree" data-bs-parent="#accordion">
                                <div class="accordion-body"><p>It depends on the distance, your timeline, and your pet's breed, age, health and temperament. Road travel suits anxious pets, snub-nosed breeds and several pets travelling together. Flying is faster for long distances. We'll recommend the safest option for your pet.</p></div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="accordion-item wow fadeInUp" data-wow-delay="1s">
                            <h2 class="accordion-header box-border-linear-gradient" id="headingFour">
                                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapseFour" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseFour">4. What documents will my pet need?</button>
                            </h2>
                            <div id="collapseFour" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="headingFour" data-bs-parent="#accordion">
                                <div class="accordion-body"><p>Domestic trips usually need a rabies certificate and, for flights, a recent health certificate. International moves can also need a microchip, titer test, import permit and USDA endorsement. After booking you get a personal checklist that you can follow on our Track page.</p></div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="accordion-item wow fadeInUp" data-wow-delay="1.25s">
                            <h2 class="accordion-header box-border-linear-gradient" id="headingFive">
                                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapseFive" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseFive">5. How do I know where my pet is?</button>
                            </h2>
                            <div id="collapseFive" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="headingFive" data-bs-parent="#accordion">
                                <div class="accordion-body"><p>You receive email updates when your booking is confirmed, when documents are complete and when travel is scheduled. For flights we give you the airline air waybill number so you can check the flight on the airline's own website. On road trips your driver sends updates along the way.</p></div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="accordion-item wow fadeInUp" data-wow-delay="1.5s">
                            <h2 class="accordion-header box-border-linear-gradient" id="headingSix">
                                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapseSix" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseSix">6. How is the price calculated?</button>
                            </h2>
                            <div id="collapseSix" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="headingSix" data-bs-parent="#accordion">
                                <div class="accordion-body"><p>Price depends on distance, the type of service, your pet's size (and crate size for flights), the number of pets and any destination requirements. Every quote is in writing and we talk it through with you before you book.</p></div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="accordion-item wow fadeInUp" data-wow-delay="1.75s">
                            <h2 class="accordion-header box-border-linear-gradient" id="headingSeven">
                                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapseSeven" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseSeven">7. How do I pay, and how can I avoid pet travel scams?</button>
                            </h2>
                            <div id="collapseSeven" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="headingSeven" data-bs-parent="#accordion">
                                <div class="accordion-body"><p>We confirm payment options when we talk through your quote. We never ask for gift cards, cryptocurrency or money-transfer apps, and we never ask for extra money while a pet is travelling to "release" it, pay "customs" or upgrade a crate. If anyone asks you to, it is a scam: contact us directly.</p></div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <!-- FAQs Accordion End -->
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <!-- FAQs Section Ends -->

    <!-- Main Footer Start  -->
    <%- include('../partials/site-footer') %>

    <!-- Jquery Library File -->
    <script src="/js/jquery-3.7.1.min.js"></script>
    <!-- Bootstrap js File -->
    <script src="/js/bootstrap.min.js"></script>
    <!-- Validator js File -->
    <script src="/js/validator.min.js"></script>
    <!-- SlickNav js File -->
    <script src="/js/jquery.slicknav.js"></script>
    <!-- Swiper js File -->
